<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-WALES CALL UP FORMER LEAGUE PLAYER SCOTT GIBBS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WALES CALL UP FORMER LEAGUE PLAYER SCOTT GIBBS.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales named former rugby league centre Scott Gibbs in a squad of 21 for their international against Italy in Rome on October 5.</p>
<p>Gibbs, 25, won 20 caps for Wales before switching to league. He returned from St Helen's to play union for Swansea this season.</p>
